{"4564990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GraveBoy CrowFeet - A Quest for Skulls", "steam_appid": 4564990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;It was a dusky day like any other in the Boneyard...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564990/extras/c8b105e7e0d059d3df34d82b0e399ade.avif?t=1780634485\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><i>Help <strong>GraveBoy CrowFeet</strong>, an undead lad, to save his father from the clutches of a demon! Explore the land between life and death to collect 10 rare skulls. Talk to ghosts, dig for bones, get cursed by a witch, be mean to ants... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Wait, don't do that last one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> <br>  <i><strong>GraveBoy CrowFeet - A Quest for Skulls is a spooky fun adventure with focus on exploration and light puzzling. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564990/extras/dfc935d8401721184e74b12ad9f26868.avif?t=1780634485\" width=100 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Walk, talk, collect items! No need to combine items via inventory, items will be used automatically whenever they're needed. No stress, no combat, no Game Overs. <i>Because GraveBoy can't die, he's already (un)dead.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Goal:</strong> Find 10 rare skulls and save your father from that demon! Some items let you unlock new areas, some items are used to solve puzzles. There is also  an alternate way to reach the ending.... Ooohhh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Length</strong>: 1-3 Hours.<br>  <br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564990/extras/a22e65a40e842f06e8777797dc54ed54.webp?t=1780634485\" width=50 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>With a soundtrack by SavePointYoomi!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564990/extras/4ea104aa420e49e291e035c31c54c00c.avif?t=1780634485\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;It was a dusky day like any other in the Boneyard...&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4564990/extras/c8b105e7e0d059d3df34d82b0e399ade.avif?t=1780634485\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><i>Help <strong>GraveBoy CrowFeet</strong>, an undead lad, to save his father from the clutches of a demon! Explore the land between life and death to collect 10 rare skulls. Talk to ghosts, dig for bones, get cursed by a witch, be mean to ants... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Wait, don't do that last one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong> <br>  <i><strong>GraveBoy CrowFeet - A Quest for Skulls is a spooky fun adventure with focus on exploration and